---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/site/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/site/Footer.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout
  title="About SwishHub Interactive"
  description="Meet Mever Daveed, Founder & CEO of SwishHub Interactive. Sales-driven web development, editorial design, and digital growth strategies from Nigeria."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Section 1: Agency Philosophy & How We Work -->
    <section class="about-agency container">
      <div class="about-header">
        <p class="section-label">ABOUT SWISHHUB INTERACTIVE</p>
        <h1>Websites built for <em>actual sales</em>, not just aesthetics.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Too many businesses invest in websites that look like digital brochures instead of revenue engines. We bridge the gap between high-craft editorial design and direct-response sales psychology.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-block">
        <h2>The Attention → Trust → Action Framework</h2>
        <div class="values-grid">
          <div class="value-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Attention First</h3>
            <p>Every headline and hero section is engineered to clarify your value and capture genuine interest within five seconds.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Uncompromising Trust</h3>
            <p>Clean editorial typography, clear proof points, and human-centered storytelling replace generic corporate clutter.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Frictionless Action</h3>
            <p>Every page guides visitors straight to clear conversions—whether through a custom brief or direct WhatsApp chat.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2: Dedicated Founder & CEO Spotlight -->
    <section class="founder-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="founder-grid">
          <!-- Left Column: CEO Portrait Placeholder -->
          <div class="founder-portrait-wrapper">
            <div class="portrait-frame" role="img" aria-label="Founder & CEO Portrait Placeholder">
              <div class="portrait-placeholder">
                <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25">
                  <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
                </svg>
                <span class="placeholder-title">CEO Portrait Placeholder</span>
                <span class="placeholder-hint">Recommended: 4:5 aspect ratio (e.g. 800×1000px)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="portrait-caption">
              <strong>Mever Daveed</strong>
              <span>Founder & Chief Executive Officer</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right Column: Personal Story -->
          <div class="founder-story">
            <p class="section-label">MEET THE FOUNDER</p>
            <h2>Why a marketer with a decade in sales started coding.</h2>

            <div class="story-paragraphs">
              <p>
                SwishHub Interactive was born out of practical frustration. As a sales and marketing professional with over ten years on the front lines, I repeatedly hired web developers who delivered visually polished sites that completely failed to convert visitors or close deals. Eventually, I decided to learn how to build them properly myself.
              </p>
              <p>
                My foundation began in storytelling and audience psychology as a graduate of Mass Communication from <strong>Ahmadu Bello University (ABU), Zaria</strong>, followed by hands-on film-making training at the <strong>Nigerian Film Institute, Jos</strong>. That background taught me how visual rhythm, narrative framing, and human emotion drive real-world decisions.
              </p>
              <p>
                Today, I operate as a hands-on builder and <strong>"vibe coder"</strong>—combining modern AI engineering with lean, high-craft web stacks to ship blazing-fast websites built specifically around conversion. I am an avid believer that practical tech and digital skills are the single strongest lever for business growth in Africa.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="founder-credentials">
              <div class="cred-item">
                <span class="cred-label">EDUCATION</span>
                <span class="cred-value">Mass Communication, ABU Zaria</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cred-item">
                <span class="cred-label">VISUAL TRAINING</span>
                <span class="cred-value">Nigerian Film Institute, Jos</span>
              </div>
              <div class="cred-item">
                <span class="cred-label">TRACK RECORD</span>
                <span class="cred-value">10+ Years in Sales & Marketing</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3: Bottom Conversion Callout -->
    <section class="about-cta container">
      <div class="founder-cta">
        <h2>Let's build something exceptional together.</h2>
        <p>Skip the agency fluff. Let's talk directly about your business goals and how we can engineer a website that actually sells.</p>
        <a href={site.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button">
          Chat directly with Mever via WhatsApp <span>↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-agency {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .about-header {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
  }

  .about-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.8vw, 4rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-block: 1rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-header h1 em {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .values-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .value-card {
    background: var(--color-paper-deep);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .value-card span {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .value-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .value-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .founder-section {
    background: var(--color-paper-deep);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7.5rem);
  }

  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .founder-portrait-wrapper {
    position: sticky;
    top: 7rem;
  }

  .portrait-frame {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .portrait-placeholder {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-line);
    margin: 1rem;
  }

  .placeholder-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .placeholder-hint {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    max-width: 220px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .portrait-caption {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .portrait-caption strong {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .portrait-caption span {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .founder-story h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 2.85rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-block: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
  }

  .story-paragraphs {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .story-paragraphs p {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-paragraphs strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .founder-credentials {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .cred-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .cred-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .cred-value {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .about-cta {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
  }

  .founder-cta {
    background: var(--color-paper-deep);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .founder-cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .founder-cta p {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .values-grid,
    .founder-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .founder-portrait-wrapper {
      position: static;
      max-width: 420px;
    }

    .founder-credentials {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>